# The image takes only what the Dockerfile COPYs (package.json,
# backend/package.json, backend/src, src/engine). This file keeps
# secrets, dependencies, build output, coverage reports, and local
# tool/editor state out of the Docker build context. Plain exclusions
# only - never a "!" re-include - and no rule below reaches inside a
# path the Dockerfile copies: an earlier version that did caused Render
# to drop src/engine from its build context (see DEPLOYMENT.md's Render
# section and this repository's git history for the investigation).
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
**/node_modules
dist
build
coverage
.claude
.vercel
.fly
.railway
**/*.log

# Local editor/IDE and OS files - never needed by the image.
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
